# A sixth Russian story: Ivan's birthday
subtitle: "Read Masha's note from her brother Ivan's birthday in Oslo, built only from lessons 1–59: a date, a year, many people, and every case at work. Hear it line by line, test what you understood by eye and by ear, say a line yourself, and look back at unit six."
teaches: ["reading/reading-stories"]
thumb: "band \"A sixth story: Ivan's birthday\" note \"lessons 51–59, 12 lines\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Verbs in -ся in Russian: учу́сь, занима́юсь","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/61-russian-reflexive.cast"}

## A sixth Russian story: Ivan's birthday
level: basic
heading: false

    glossed s1 "Приве́т, Том! Сего́дня двадца́тое января́." say_voice b gloss ["","","","twentieth","of January"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s2 "У моего́ бра́та Ива́на день рожде́ния." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","of birth"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s3 "Он роди́лся в январе́, и ты то́же!" say_voice b gloss ["","was born","","January","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s4 "В его́ но́вой кварти́ре мно́го люде́й." say_voice b gloss ["","","","flat","","people"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Я зна́ю его́ дру́га и его́ сосе́да." say_voice b gloss ["","","","friend","","","neighbour"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s6 "Друг рабо́тает врачо́м, а сосе́д был учи́телем." say_voice b gloss ["friend","","as a doctor","","neighbour","","as a teacher"] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 990 font_size 42 hidden true
    glossed s7 "Я дарю́ моему́ бра́ту кни́гу о Москве́." say_voice b gloss ["","","to my","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s8 "Ма́ма звони́т Ива́ну, а па́па пи́шет ему́." say_voice b gloss ["","phones","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
