    glossed s10 "Ве́чером Ива́н игра́ет на гита́ре с дру́гом." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","","friend"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 990 font_size 42 hidden true
    glossed s11 "Мы говори́м о ма́ме и о ба́бушке." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
